            {
                "entry_id": "f34ae8e7-680e-34c1-952a-896812ad956d",
                "word": "geist",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "94c07fd5-7608-4e8a-9001-5f9caee293e3",
                        "entry_id": "f34ae8e7-680e-34c1-952a-896812ad956d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "geists"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0c15c4a6-0151-339e-8ea0-e8ad77cd5c8e",
                        "entry_id": "f34ae8e7-680e-34c1-952a-896812ad956d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A ghost, an apparition."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7d92d1c-3c4c-40f0-97fe-ac3b26d05eb4",
                                "sense_id": "0c15c4a6-0151-339e-8ea0-e8ad77cd5c8e",
                                "text": "The geists eat and drink, but only as geists — not as spirits. ' We have dined,' they say ' sumptuously.' A vapour- ... If dead men tell no tales, their geists will tell them, if they find opportunity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "827a6440-3ae9-4483-a035-1fd838be6a90",
                                "sense_id": "0c15c4a6-0151-339e-8ea0-e8ad77cd5c8e",
                                "text": "Koerg was not slow to recognize a geist; his knees shook, and he dared not utter a word."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b630e826-d37a-46b1-be71-4168b69a8740",
                                "sense_id": "0c15c4a6-0151-339e-8ea0-e8ad77cd5c8e",
                                "text": "[...] it makes no difference whether these figures were real, corporeal beings or not, since each one, in terms of Freud's (auto) aesthetic, is a spirit, a geist, a complex function of Freud's worldview."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5be63f50-3bc8-39be-a782-4485561834a9",
                        "entry_id": "f34ae8e7-680e-34c1-952a-896812ad956d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Spirit (of a group, age, era, etc)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9b01a28-a66b-40e4-8eca-b52c32a039d4",
                                "sense_id": "5be63f50-3bc8-39be-a782-4485561834a9",
                                "text": "The population that today explodes on a stagnant society with a catastrophic echo, is the geist of the times that shock our great nation into a new sense of her grandeur."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "884f6231-018d-4a9c-8c1f-c6559388ab80",
                                "sense_id": "5be63f50-3bc8-39be-a782-4485561834a9",
                                "text": "However, the geist of the times following the World War was the \"normalcy\" of Warren G. Harding."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "262cc420-5800-4dd2-ab3d-8f42585545f1",
                                "sense_id": "5be63f50-3bc8-39be-a782-4485561834a9",
                                "text": "[...] a term badly applied, as the method is neither a historicism (the belief that each era or period has a geist, principle of identity, or a definable sense of destiny) nor new."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8738fbf8-45dd-455d-9ca9-00ad7648c27a",
                                "sense_id": "5be63f50-3bc8-39be-a782-4485561834a9",
                                "text": "... particular 'culture areas' of the world are dominated by their own peculiar geist or 'cultural soul' ..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
